    "Structured in layers": "分层结构",
    "3D design has become a core part of how I think and create. It teaches me spatial awareness, precision, and how to bring abstract ideas into tangible form. Whether I'm modeling, animating, or exploring new workflows, I approach each project with focus and curiosity. Working in 3D challenges me to grow—not just technically, but creatively—bridging imagination and structure in every piece.": "3D 设计已成为我思考和创作的核心部分。它教会了我空间意识、精确度，以及如何将抽象的构思转化为具象的实体。无论是建模、制作动画还是探索新的工作流，我都以专注和好奇的态度对待每一个项目。3D 创作不断挑战着我的成长——不仅在技术上，更在创造力上——在每一件作品中将想象力与结构完美融合。",
