    "Powered by intelligence": "由智能驱动",
    "AI and coding have become my way of exploring how ideas evolve into intelligent systems. I'm driven by the challenge of teaching machines to think, create, and assist—while refining my own logic and creativity in the process. From designing intuitive interfaces to building smart, adaptive algorithms, I focus on blending human insight with computational precision. I stay curious, innovative, and committed to shaping technology that feels alive and meaningful.": "AI 与编程已成为我探索构思如何演变为智能系统的方式。我被“教导机器去思考、创作和协助”这一挑战所驱动，并在过程中不断打磨自身的逻辑与创造力。从设计直观的界面到构建智能、自适应的算法，我专注于将人类的洞察力与计算精度相结合。我始终保持好奇心与创新精神，致力于塑造兼具生命力与意义的技术。",
    "Selected Work": "精选作品",
    "A private, open-source personal finance app with AI receipt/voice entry, wallets, budgets, recurring transactions, and a fully customizable dashboard — free to use instantly, or self-host your own.": "一款私密的开源个人理财应用，支持 AI 收据/语音记账、多钱包管理、预算、周期性交易，以及可完全自定义的仪表盘——可立即免费使用，也可自托管。",
    "© Kittinat Gerdsri": "© Kittinat Gerdsri",
    "Tools": "工具",
    "Project 01": "项目 01",
    "Private personal finance, reimagined": "重新构想的私密理财体验",
    "Tally is a private, open-source personal finance app — snap a photo of a receipt or speak a transaction out loud and AI fills in the details, then track it across wallets, budgets, recurring bills, and savings goals on a dashboard you build yourself. Every account's data is fully isolated, so you can create one on the live instance in seconds with nothing to deploy, or self-host your own.": "Tally 是一款注重隐私的开源个人理财应用——只需拍下收据或用语音说出一笔交易，AI 就会帮你填好细节，随后你可以在自己搭建的仪表盘上，通过多个钱包、预算、周期性账单和储蓄目标进行追踪。每个账户的数据都完全隔离，你可以在现有的在线实例上几秒钟内创建账户，无需自行部署，也可以选择自托管。",
    "Try Tally →": "立即试用 Tally →",
