    "A complete Formula 1 concept car built from scratch in Blender — modeled, textured with a custom livery, rigged for suspension and steering, and animated into cinematic shots. This project taught me the full 3D pipeline: from blocking out geometry to lighting a scene, animating a camera, and rendering a finished sequence.": "一辆在 Blender 中从零打造的完整 F1 概念车——完成了建模、定制涂装贴图、悬挂与转向绑定，并制作成了电影感镜头的动画。这个项目让我掌握了完整的 3D 制作流程：从几何体构型、场景布光、相机动画到最终序列渲染。",
