    "Inspired by emotion": "灵感源于情感",
    "Art and design are my way of exploring how imagination transforms into visual expression. I'm\n          driven by the challenge of turning ideas into forms that communicate, inspire, and connect — while refining my\n          own creativity and sense of detail along the way. From crafting sleek digital interfaces to illustrating\n          dynamic, expressive scenes, I focus on blending emotion with visual precision. I stay curious, inventive, and\n          committed to creating visuals that feel alive and meaningful.": "艺术与设计是我探索想象力如何转化为视觉表达的方式。我被”将构思化为能够传达、启发并连接人心的形态”这一挑战所驱动，并在过程中不断打磨自己的创造力与对细节的感知。从雕琢流畅的数字界面到绘制动感且富有表现力的场景，我专注于将情感与视觉精度相融合。我始终保持好奇、充满创意，并致力于创造有生命力且富有意义的视觉作品。",
    "© Kittinat Gerdsri · Shoe design used: Nike ZoomX Streakfly 2": "© Kittinat Gerdsri · 引用鞋款设计：Nike ZoomX Streakfly 2",
    "KAO Environment Painting Contest": "花王国际环境绘画大赛",
    "\"Let's use bioplastics - 13th KAO International Environment Painting Contest 2022 - Hand-drawn": "“让我们使用生物塑料吧” - 第 13 届花王国际环境绘画大赛 2022 - 手绘作品",
    "Toyota Dream Car Art Contest": "丰田梦想汽车艺术大赛",
    "RBTW Machine - This car is driven by solar and wind power. Its big vacuum panel can collect\n        trash and classify them. It turns food waste to fertilizer for new seeds. It can dig holes and plant trees.\n\n        A big water tank supplies water to trees and help to put out fire. Forest is rebuilt. Animals are back. -\n        TOYOTA Dream Car Art Contest 2022 - Adobe Illustrator": "RBTW 机器 - 这款车由太阳能和风能驱动。其大型真空面板能够收集并分类垃圾。它能将厨余垃圾转化为新种子的肥料，还能挖坑种树。大型水箱为树木供水并协助灭火。森林得以重建，生灵重返家园。- 丰田梦想汽车艺术大赛 2022 - Adobe Illustrator",
