    "A multidisciplinary creator working across AI, coding, robotics, graphic design, 3D animation, sports and music — building things that are clean, purposeful, and meaningful.": "一位横跨 AI、编程、机器人、平面设计、3D 动画、体育和音乐领域的跨学科创作者——致力于打造简洁、专注且富有意义的作品。",
