    "About": "关于",
    "Kittinat Gerdsri": "Kittinat Gerdsri",
    "I'm a multidisciplinary creator blending technology, design, and structured thinking. With a foundation in mathematics, sciences, and languages, I approach problem-solving with clarity and logic — applied through AI, coding, and robotics to build intelligent, real-world systems.": "我是一位将技术、设计与结构化思维完美融合的跨学科创作者。凭借在数学、科学和语言学方面的扎实基础，我以清晰的逻辑来应对问题——并通过 AI、编程与机器人技术将其付诸实践，构建出智能的现实世界系统。",
    "Alongside this, I express ideas visually through graphic design, drawing, 3D design, animation, and photography, focusing on clean and purposeful outputs. I value teamwork and collaboration as key drivers of innovation. Sports, especially athletics and football, build my discipline and resilience, while piano strengthens my creativity and focus.": "与此同时，我通过平面设计、绘画、3D 设计、动画和摄影以视觉化的方式表达构思，追求干净利落且目标明确的成果。我珍视团队合作与协同，将其视为创新的核心驱动力。体育运动（尤其是田径和足球）培养了我的纪律性与抗压能力，而钢琴则增强了我的创造力与专注力。",
    "Ultimately, I aim to create work that connects creativity and engineering — simple, functional, and meaningful." : "最终，我致力于创作能够连结创意与工程的作品——简单、实用而意义深远。",
