    "Guided by melody": "以旋律领航",
    "Music has been a core part of my identity. It teaches me creativity, patience, and how to express emotion with precision. Whether I'm practicing, performing, or producing, I bring the same focus and curiosity to every note. Music pushes me to grow—not just technically, but emotionally.": "音乐一直是我身份认同的核心部分。它教会了我创造力、耐心，以及如何精准地表达情感。无论是在练习、表演还是编曲，我对每一个音符都倾注了同样的专注与好奇。音乐推动着我不断成长——不仅在技术上，更在情感共鸣上。",
