    "Inspired by form and ambient lighting": "灵感源于形态与环境光影",
    "Photography has become a core part of who I am. It teaches me how to see the world differently—through light, detail, and perspective. Whether I'm capturing a fleeting moment or carefully composing a shot, I bring patience, focus, and creativity into every frame. Photography challenges me to tell stories without words and to find meaning in the smallest details. It pushes me to grow—not just in skill, but in how I observe and understand the world around me.": "摄影已成为我不可或缺的一部分。它教会了我如何通过光影、细节和视角以全新眼光看待世界。无论是捕捉稍纵即逝的瞬间还是精心构图，我都将耐心、专注和创造力倾注于每一帧画面。摄影挑战着用无声的镜头讲述故事，在微小的细节中寻觅意义，推动着我在技能以及观察、理解世界的方式上不断成长。",
