    "Designed with purpose": "因目的而设计",
    "Robotics has become my way of turning ideas into real, moving systems. I'm driven by the challenge of building machines that can sense, decide, and act, while sharpening my problem-solving and engineering skills. From integrating hardware to programming intelligent behavior, I focus on creating robots that are both functional and adaptive.": "机器人技术成了我将构思变为现实、可动系统的方式。我被“制造能够感知、决策和行动的机器”这一挑战所驱使，并在过程中磨炼了解决问题和工程实践的能力。从硬件集成到智能行为编程，我专注于创造兼具实用性与自适应能力的机器人。",
